3. Webshop Local API Endpoints:
   - POST /api/payment/zalopay/create
     * Request body: { "orderId": Integer }
     * Action: Calls ZaloPay API, maps transaction, sets status to PENDING.
   - POST /api/payment/zalopay/callback
     * Request body: { "data": String, "mac": String }
     * Action: Receives ZaloPay notification, verifies HMAC-SHA256 signature, applies pessimistic lock, revalidates inventory, updates status, clears cart.
   - GET /api/payment/zalopay/query/{appTransId}
     * Action: Queries current payment status from gateway and syncs with database.
   - POST /api/payment/zalopay/cancel/{appTransId}
     * Action: Cancels pending order, transitions payment status to CANCELLED.

4. Implementation Constraints:
   - Stock is only decremented and items are only cleared from the cart after callback returns success.
   - One-way state transitions (PENDING -> PAID/FAILED/CANCELLED/EXPIRED).
   - Pessimistic write lock (findByIdWithLock) is applied on SanPhamChiTiet during success confirmation to prevent race conditions.
   - Pending ZaloPay transactions older than 30 minutes are automatically transitioned to EXPIRED by scheduler.
